OL,3,CManchester Village Pride pays tribute
OL,4,Cafter deadly Berlin Pride incident
OL,6,FManchester Village Pride has paid
OL,7,Ftribute to those affected by the
OL,8,Fdeadly incident at Berlin Pride,
OL,9,Fexpressing its solidarity with the
OL,10,Fcity's LGBTQ+ community.
OL,12,FA van slammed into people gathered for
OL,13,Fthe festival in the German capital on
OL,14,FSaturday, killing one person and
OL,15,Finjuring 29 others.
OL,17,FThe suspect, who has been named as
OL,18,FAbdul Ballout, went on to stab others,
OL,19,Faccording to authorities, who said he
OL,20,Fremains at large and may be armed and
OL,21,Fdangerous.
