OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785086293
OL,3,CManchester Village Pride pays tribute
OL,4,Cafter deadly Berlin Pride incident
OL,6,FIt is believed to be an act of Islamic
OL,7,Fterror, Germany's interior minister
OL,8,FAlexander Dobrindt said.
OL,10,FManchester Village Pride said it was
OL,11,F"deeply saddened" by the events, which
OL,12,Fsaw a car drive into people attending
OL,13,FBerlin Pride.
OL,15,FIn a statement, Manchester Village
OL,16,FPride said: "Our thoughts and prayers
OL,17,Fare with everyone affected, including
OL,18,Fthose who have been injured, their
OL,19,Floved ones, and the entire LGBTQ+
OL,20,Fcommunity."
OL,26,@sD@AOUsD@QO]xD@MOU|D@KO]
