PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785086293
OL,3,CManchester Village Pride pays tribute
OL,4,Cafter deadly Berlin Pride incident
OL,6,FThe organisation added that Pride
OL,7,Fevents represent far more than
OL,8,Fcelebrations.
OL,10,F"Pride is a celebration of love,
OL,11,Fdiversity, inclusion, and the freedom
OL,12,Fto be who you are. When one Pride
OL,13,Fcommunity is impacted, we all stand
OL,14,Ftogether in solidarity."
OL,16,FIt concluded by sending "love,
OL,17,Fstrength, and unwavering support" to
OL,18,Fthe Berlin Pride community during what
OL,19,Fit described as a difficult time.
